# Stakeholder Power/Interest Matrix – IWMS Project


- ![Stakeholder Power/Interest Matrix](https://github.com/LA-cmd-prompt/Integrated-Workplace-Real-Estate-Management-System-IWMS-/blob/main/Artifacts/Stakeholder%20Power%20Interest%20Matrix%202026-10-16%20at%204.54.08%20PM.jpeg)




| Quadrant          | Stakeholders                                      | Recommended Approach                                      |
|-------------------|---------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| **Manage Closely**    | COO, CFO, Head of IT, HR Manager                 | Frequent meetings, detailed updates, involve in key decisions |
| **Keep Satisfied**    | Company Secretary, Head of Procurement           | Periodic updates, address concerns quickly               |
| **Keep Informed**     | Property Managers, Architects, Prospective Tenants | Regular communication, demos, training sessions          |
| **Monitor**           | Finance / Accounting Team                        | Occasional updates, escalate only when needed            |

